# `data/` was excluded in the original workspace, where it was a live working
# store rebuilt by `octavia.py init`. In this repository the handoff is an
# ARCHIVE: data/ holds the six reference photographs, the asset database and
# the 53 preserved source documents. Excluding it would discard the very
# thing this package exists to carry, so the rule is deliberately removed.
